testdata/err/026_var_func_as_field.aic:2:11: error: type name is missing
    a type name is required here
    fix: add a type name such as i32, str, or a class name; a type is never optional
testdata/err/026_var_func_as_field.aic:2:22: error: missing `)`
    got KW return
    fix: parenthesised type is missing the closing `)`
testdata/err/026_var_func_as_field.aic:2:29: error: a class body holds fields and methods only
    got INT 1
    fix: write a field as `var name Type`, a method as `func name(...)`, a constructor as `func init(...)`
testdata/err/026_var_func_as_field.aic:3:1: error: a non-declaration statement at the top level
    got PUNCT }
    fix: the top level holds import / const / func / class / interface / enum (optionally with export, extern, or annotations)
